# Task 3: Runs page markup — analytics-runs table and modal shell

## Context

Continuing the Task 1/2 work above: analytics run history is moving off the
Knowledge Graph → Analytics tab onto Knowledge Graph → Management → Runs, as
a second table stacked below the existing build-runs table (the two share no
columns, so they stay separate rather than merging). This task adds only the
markup and the modal shell — ids, classes, and structure that the next task's
JavaScript will target. No JavaScript was written or modified.

## Changes

1. `src/front/templates/partials/domain/_domain_runs.html` — Replaced
   entirely: kept the build-runs table and its `runsLoading` / `runsEmpty` /
   `runsError` / `runsErrorMessage` / `runsTableWrapper` / `runsTableBody`
   ids unchanged, removed the `runsVersionFilter` dropdown (it only ever
