## Changes

### Part A — dead Runs section on the Domain page

1. `src/front/templates/domain.html` — Deleted the `#runs-section` div (and
   its `_domain_runs.html` include). Kept the page-level `runDetailsModal`
   and the `domain-runs.js` `<script>` tag: `domain-audit.js:210-211` calls
   `window.showRunDetailsObj(run)` to expand build entries in the audit
   timeline, so both must survive even though the section that used to open
   the modal from a Runs tab is gone.
2. `src/front/static/domain/js/domain.js` — Deleted the
   `section === 'runs'` hook in `SidebarNav.init`'s `onSectionChange`
