3. `tests/units/api/test_ui_rendering.py` — Removed `"runs-section"` from
   `TestDomainPage.test_section_div_exists`'s parametrize list; added
   `test_no_dead_runs_section` (file-read: the id is gone from
   `domain.html`) and `test_run_details_modal_and_script_survive`
   (rendered-HTML: `domain-runs.js` and `#runDetailsModal` still ship on
